component StackGrid

template
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 py-24 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-950 transition-colors">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[640px] h-[320px] rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto">

      <p class="text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-500 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Stacks and domains</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-3">Every stack you run, and the domains it lives on</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mb-8">Pick a stack, point it at your repo and server, and Tylix handles the build and release steps. Manage the domain and its DNS from the same place.</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 max-w-md mb-12">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3">
