              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span> Domain management
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-3">Your domains, next to your servers</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-6">Connect your registrar once. Then see every domain, edit its DNS and watch renewals without leaving the deployer.</p>

            <ul class="space-y-3 mb-7">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400"><span class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 font-medium">All domains in one list.</span> Expiry dates and status at a glance.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400"><span class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 font-medium">DNS records.</span> Add, change and remove them, and point a domain at your server.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400"><span class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 font-medium">Renewals.</span> See which domains expire soon before they lapse.</p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400"><span class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 font-medium">Email and billing.</span> Check mail settings and the registrar account from the same page.</p>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-slate-500 text-xs mr-1">Works with</span>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Porkbun</span>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Cloudflare</span>
